{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1699.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"87225bf2fdf5e665c88870284e5a42573895946f174983f136929066da6959de","ja":"今日のロケ場所、美肌効果で有名な温泉地なのよね♪\nふふっ、楽しみだわ～♪","zh":"今天的拍摄地点，是以美肤效果闻名的温泉胜地呢♪\n呵呵，真让人期待呀～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1699.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"4abccc656244d48f40a9ea86fbc82904fd732c40a59390c404ce57a5179a2aff","ja":"チッチッチ……甘い！　甘いよこのみん！\nせっかくの、ウキウキあはんな温泉レポなんだよ！","zh":"啧啧啧……太天真了！太天真了，木实！\n这可是难得的、让人心花怒放又性感的温泉报告啊！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1699.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"37344bc81c9d52376782ead9f749e7cd2da0a0e7c944119935a15231b3e7c9fa","ja":"これはもう、この前のリベンジを\nするっきゃないっしょ！","zh":"这下可非得把上次的仇给报了\n不可了吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1699.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"f2de1abbd0d4e0980b333e86c6e9c5cd597331a032d04f833f414009a5769d44","ja":"いざ、スーパーセクシー対決！\nじんじょーに勝負～～っ！","zh":"看招，超级性感大对决！\n堂堂正正一决胜负～～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1699.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"ea29e20bbc7e28ecf431d5e84b2805079f663899c78eb0f16147434e2e23a97f","ja":"リベンジって……ああ、この間は結局、\nできなかったわね、セクシー対決。","zh":"你说要复仇……啊，上次那场性感对决，\n结果没能办成呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1699.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"63e158349a81f4511d2533d7687c43f933cf53b32205b9c8fbedc6d5e1be0821","ja":"その通り！　だから今日の温泉レポで、\nナンバーワンセクシーを決めるんだよ！","zh":"没错！所以今天就要通过温泉探访，\n决出谁才是第一性感！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1699.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"eca88cf38d997ea97c4fa67f15ca7724fbc8c1a0d3717a9c47f2e39a997898e0","ja":"ふふっ、わかったわ！\nそういうことなら受けて立つわよ♪","zh":"呵呵，我知道了！\n既然这样的话，我奉陪到底哦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1699.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"34bf131c51ce8de6fdb76b00fbf621a1bad8d970f13c04a084869936ca637fe5","ja":"露天風呂にゆっくり浸かりながら、\nうっとりと景色を見つめる……。","zh":"在露天温泉里悠闲地泡着，\n陶醉地凝视着眼前的景色……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1699.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"8e2200f8f59d1041f901efc018375b9b27fc31088cc5ceea8ab795499d5b14a3","ja":"しっとりした大人の女性の魅力、見せてあげるわ！","zh":"让你见识一下成熟女性温婉沉静的魅力！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1699.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"3462f62ddf6c3ac86375bc71f7576349a160a441ef75cb630240456f40768b50","ja":"真美だって負けないかんね！　温泉と言えば浴衣！\n浴衣と言えば、はだけたすき間からのチラリズム！","zh":"真美也是不会输的！说起温泉那就是浴衣！\n说起浴衣，那就是衣襟敞开的缝隙里若隐若现的春光！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1699.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"d513d9d9af3d5dff92313553b05b0d2c6608ff5f41cb4388a2163b9668d2fcef","ja":"し、しまった！\n確かに、温泉に入るだけが温泉ロケじゃないわね……。","zh":"糟、糟了！\n确实，温泉外景可不仅仅是泡温泉呢……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1699.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"30de62f8ede78cf5ac26d085e816d87e57169adf107e05fa4683170f2cdb7d22","ja":"んっふっふ～♪\n勝負はカメラが回った瞬間から始まって……。","zh":"嗯哼哼～♪\n胜负从镜头开始转动的那一刻就已经打响了……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1699.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"c4809464e038cd702bb52768f7efcf7ab1525d5e50ea823a9a5ec358bd4fac04","ja":"「お疲れさまです。そろそろ出発しますので、\n衣装にお着替えお願いします！」","zh":"“辛苦了。差不多该出发了，\n请换上演出服装吧！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1699.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"78a8fdd8e815e0e1263a3bd156578e9b1470f500dac9498624f9acae4c335663","ja":"……へ？　衣装で温泉ロケすんの？","zh":"……诶？要穿演出服装去温泉出外景吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
